# Unslop — TA queue + student asks (visual only)

Scope: `TaWorkspace.jsx`, `StudentAsksPage.jsx`, shared tokens in `styles.css`.
No other pages. No prop/hook/API/router changes. No new dependencies.

## Tokens (reuse existing theme)
- Colors: `--theme-ink`, `--theme-forest`, `--theme-deep`, `--theme-mist`, `--theme-sand`, `--theme-surface` / `aui-*` utilities already in `@theme`.
- Type: `--font-sans` (Source Sans 3), `--font-display` (Source Serif 4) only — no Inter/Roboto/Arial swap-ins.
- Radius: keep existing `rounded-lg` / `rounded-xl` on interactive cards; do not add new pill clusters or multi-shadow stacks.
- Spacing: tighten stacked gaps to a consistent `gap-3`/`gap-4` / `mt-3` rhythm; avoid one-off magic margins.

## Copy (plain campus voice)
- Prefer product names already in glossary: Ask Triage, Help Coach, Quiet ask.
- Cut AI tells: "AI-powered", "smart draft", emoji flourishes in empty states, hype verbs ("magic", "instant genius").
- Buttons: verb + object ("Claim ask", "Send reply", "Ask for help") — short.

## TA queue
- One clear hierarchy: queue list → selected ask → actions. Demote Help Coach chrome; keep coach controls usable.
- Status pills stay functional; no extra badge rows or decorative icon strips.

## Student asks
- Keep stage timeline readable; reduce dashed-box / muted microcopy noise.
- Empty state: one sentence + one CTA.

## Forbidden
- New cards for non-interactive content; layout rewrites; dark-mode experiments; purple glow trends.
- Changing fetch/auth/queue filter logic or Help Coach API payloads.
